# sdist completeness (fix #85): the source distribution ships the full
# evidence tree so the test suite reproduces from the sdist alone.
# The wheel stays runtime-only (the savage_standard package plus its
# key_registry.json package-data) — tests and fixtures are never
# installed into site-packages.
graft fixtures
graft tests
graft vendor
include GROUND_TRUTH.md BEFORE-MEASUREMENT.md LANDING.md
